    <p>
      Every metric was scored against label sets frozen from outside this codebase before any metric ran (Korenjak-Černe
      clusters, Hahn-Klimroth rule classes, stage thresholds, RIETI's China-2020 ≈ Japan-1990 window; the Yoshida
      epitome sequence is reported, not gated) plus continuity and an outlier check (the Gulf states must be the most
      isolated pyramids of 2024). The menu is a mechanical consequence of these verdicts; “menu” verdicts marked
      provisional await the human-triplet test.
